  "created": "2026-11-20T14:11:19.58Z",
  "description": "ExpertXls Excel Library creates, edits and reads Excel workbooks in the Excel 97-2003 (.xls) and Excel 2007 or later (.xlsx) formats in any .NET application, without Microsoft Excel: cell styles, number formats, formulas, charts, pictures, hyperlinks, data validation, conditional formatting, Excel tables, AutoFilter, sort, find and replace, sparklines, CSV and DataTable import and export, page setup and protection.\n\nThis package contains the library for .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8.1, .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET 5 to .NET 11 (through .NET Standard 2.0). It is the build for 64-bit (x64) applications; for x86 and AnyCPU applications use ExpertXls.ExcelLibrary.\n\nFeatures\n- Create new workbooks or edit existing ones; open and save files, streams and byte arrays\n- Excel 97-2003 (.xls) and Excel 2007 or later (.xlsx) formats\n- Cells and ranges in A1 notation or by row and column index, named ranges, merged cells\n- Text, number, date and boolean values with Excel number formats\n- Named workbook styles: solid, pattern and gradient fills, fonts, borders, alignment, text rotation\n- Formulas and array formulas in A1 and R1C1 notation, calculated by the library on request\n- 2D and 3D charts in worksheets and chart worksheets, with generated or custom series\n- Pictures, hyperlinks, cell comments and data validation\n- Conditional formatting: cell value and formula rules, color scales, data bars, icon sets; sparklines (.xlsx)\n- Excel tables with built-in styles and a totals row (.xlsx), AutoFilter, sorting by several columns\n- Find and replace in a range, a worksheet or the whole workbook\n- Import from CSV and export to CSV; load from and get to System.Data.DataTable\n- Page setup for printing: paper, margins, headers and footers with pictures\n- Worksheet and workbook protection, password to open Excel 97-2003 workbooks",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.jpg",
