  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.0: part of the ExpertPdf 22.0 release, requires a version 10 license key. New C# and VB.NET samples for .NET Framework 4.6.2, .NET 10 and .NET 11 (Windows Forms, console, ASP.NET Web Forms, Blazor) and updated documentation. New: conditional formatting, AutoFilter, sort, Excel tables, find and replace, sparklines.",
